Maintainer: Rafael Leon <rafa.leon190@gmail.com>
Description: Build infographic-style PDF layouts in R by composing pages as
    vertical stacks of rows. Mix text, ggplot2 plots, images, and grobs in the
    same row. Export to PDF with predictable sizing using grid units.
SystemRequirements: Cairo (optional but recommended for full UTF-8 PDF output;
    macOS users should install XQuartz from https://www.xquartz.org)
